      "translation": "我真不知道他们这么做"
    },
    {
      "start": 12820,
      "text": "Who knew we owned eight thousand salad plates?",
      "tokens": [],
      "credit": false,
      "translation": "装沙拉的盘子有八千个"
    },
    {
      "start": 17260,
      "text": "For years I’ve roamed these empty halls",
      "tokens": [],
      "credit": false,
      "translation": "空空的舞厅常走过"
    },
    {
      "start": 19830,
      "text": "Why have a ballroom with no balls?",
      "tokens": [],
      "credit": false,
      "translation": "不举行舞会做什么"
    },
    {
      "start": 22200,
      "text": "Finally they’re opening up the gates",
